              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Two riders armed with hand weapon and short bow riding a camel. Light Camelry. Cause Fear in cavalry. Stealth in soft sand or dunes. The model has two shots per turn and counts as two figures for unit strength purposes. Both figures may shoot from the same face of the figure’s base.</characteristic>
