  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="6b66-1f84-7365-9fc7" name="Arab Nomads (AoA2) - List Notes" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false">
      <description>ARMIES OF ANTIQUITY v2 #109 (unofficial, Martin Gibbins). The tribes of the Arabian Peninsula were a menace to Egypt and Syria, though fortunately never a unified force. Their extensive use of camels makes this a distinctively different nomad horde. 

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Arab Nomads]
  Camelry: up to 25%
  Characters: up to 33%
  Infantry: at least 25%
  Characters: up to 33% Camelry: up to 25% Infantry: At least 25%</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
